The install instructions for reading saved epochs install mne-bids PR #1679 (`git+https://github.com/mne-tools/mne-bids.git@refs/pull/1679/head`). They said to install mne-bids `main`, which cannot read FIF epochs either, since the PR is not merged. CI now also runs the saved-epoch tests, which the test matrix skips on released mne-bids, in a job with the PR installed, and fails if any of them is skipped there.
